//   # a HOCON comment, and a blank line above it, are part of the header too

// expect: exit 0
// A header that names no dependency is a program with none, and an `avin.hocon` comment line
// anywhere but the top would be refused, so this one says `avin dot hocon` instead.

main()
    println("no dependencies")
